    "text": "Note:\n1. Criteria considered for deciding retirement age is as follows:\n   a) Government Sector – Based on \"Date of Retirement of Subscriber\" in CRA System.\n   b) All Citizen – Based on Date of Birth + 60 years.\n   c) Corporate – Based on \"Date of retirement\", or if unavailable, DOB + 60 years.\n   d) NPS Lite – GDS: DOB + 65 years; Non-GDS: DOB + 60 years."
